sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser cache
    participant CDN as CDN
    participant O as Origin

    B->>CDN: GET /api/products
    CDN->>O: forward
    O-->>CDN: 200 + ETag v42 + Cache-Control
    CDN-->>B: 200 (cached both layers)
    B->>CDN: GET + If-None-Match v42
    CDN-->>B: 304 Not Modified
    O->>CDN: purge on data change
    B->>CDN: GET + If-None-Match v42
    CDN->>O: revalidate
    O-->>CDN: 200 + ETag v43
